            <div xml:id="m-72e9333a-4594-4bf9-8138-d18fd7d76d63">
              <lg xml:id="m-f1f5b9b0-80ee-4cf2-9cd4-4c77b5b2ddb2">
                <l xml:id="m-c93ae8a0-2a8d-489f-b554-44f52d04b2a3" facs="#m-227ce0fe-6a65-4a08-9d1f-9e14d3554fc4" label="ambiguous">278</l><l xml:id="m-de545a66-951a-4d91-8ae4-d68dc483e0fb" facs="#m-957712bb-8206-41ed-9fde-98914af115c9" label="text-like">Feast of the Sacred Heart of Mesus.</l><l xml:id="m-705bec20-6964-43a8-a92f-35da01b7af37" facs="#m-981f1cdd-665f-4b06-96f4-07712816dee3" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-9c7589ca-f791-4104-8b2b-13486e5047a7" facs="#m-00d6b1a3-7ecb-49b7-9c69-008333f19098" label="lyrics-like">Ant. In caritáte perpétua. p. 977.</l><l xml:id="m-98640b32-711c-4e83-bea9-03f675e0cfbd" facs="#m-47dcfdd7-3ba2-4f88-8d78-175b47ccd34e" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f44976c8-87f0-46c4-b119-0a4a82acb84d" facs="#m-803010ba-bb83-4d42-92f9-37eb2c1a2048" label="ambiguous">Eph. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-497c233a-d02b-487f-8cac-3a56a9ab2805" facs="#m-06f92427-dfed-4d69-8eb6-70a2acffab52" label="lyrics-like">Ujus rei grátia flecto génua mea l borári per Spíritum ejus in interió¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a09a0e1-5a06-4f02-9067-d94ee7073cde" facs="#m-7d048e5b-1199-4af9-8761-3fd60b005f5a" label="lyrics-like">I ad Patrem Dómini nostri Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-cea02a6b-4093-4bfb-8256-15c5596c5f1a" facs="#m-094358dd-00b0-4f56-a067-396d26b564c8" label="lyrics-like">rem hóminem:* Christum habitáre</l><l xml:id="m-62526d2f-4c37-4cd1-940c-b5b774a9e806" facs="#m-fec7ca8d-ad76-49af-bb7f-546c901fec1e" label="lyrics-like">Christi, f ut det vobis secúndum ]per fidem in córdibus vestris.</l><l xml:id="m-1f625197-a04e-4973-b14a-1f370c2ffbd1" facs="#m-950e1fab-263b-4165-8373-4451737dbb05" label="lyrics-like">divitias glóriae suae virtúte corro¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf141872-e4ae-44b0-b424-8bc3052ab4bd" facs="#m-524b5447-8360-404d-a0b3-2f9fe4ec05e9" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-23667290-ff32-4c85-8d87-85143d49133a" facs="#m-1e132f27-e5aa-49cc-9f46-46e064cff0b1" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-f67fb985-488b-4fa8-b9db-6fc64d6195d7" facs="#m-e87399d1-ef28-4ed4-8281-80f3819eb91e" label="lyrics-like">g0dí-xi : Dómine,“Mi-seré- re mé-i</l><l xml:id="m-d9ff0779-e43e-4705-bf81-23c0a6d1906c" facs="#m-ecf14d53-8009-4943-a8bb-c079239c916a" label="ambiguous">Ego.</l><l xml:id="m-aea23385-bbf6-43db-aba7-db2127271744" facs="#m-ff80e20e-7ed7-4b7c-a78b-93da6d62bf97" label="ambiguous">"Mi-se¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b120be7-6416-41f0-9895-bfe410b6a33f" facs="#m-524cb928-7e59-4487-b61d-9cf42f5c0946" label="lyrics-like">V. Sána ánimam mé-am, qui-a peccá-vi tí-bi.</l><l xml:id="m-aacf8155-14fc-4dd9-b2f5-8b3bf565009e" facs="#m-6a179f93-089e-4830-b7b3-8a930d3b0225" label="lyrics-like">ré- re. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Ego.</l><l xml:id="m-02e2ea12-07f1-4b38-8f52-4eb53b993b97" facs="#m-36132a81-e3f4-4a67-b65f-0c3c637c2cf8" label="lyrics-like">v. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum miserátor Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-100d59c7-5645-4962-9a25-8ca10e976492" facs="#m-eda59125-f63b-4456-aa81-5ed7cd125a0b" label="lyrics-like">R. Escam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-053c1607-dfeb-439a-a92c-239a1a0a2ee3" facs="#m-b89d4cc2-5467-48d3-adc9-290ca286e290" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-ea0c3d1e-8537-4694-b3d4-bb733ca3e419" facs="#m-27f97413-466b-47b8-8671-c4b3d9e25528" label="ambiguous">Ant. Fili. p. 977.</l><l xml:id="m-fa70f6cf-9162-4e50-b4e3-22dd1712b821" facs="#m-2d54e55e-2e78-4e7f-9d57-215675dd4971" label="ambiguous">Eph. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-c00fc862-4c60-4e5b-9ecd-a1d911780add" facs="#m-e6ef0d87-ac2f-43c5-9cd2-1e36573a90d0" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-4cbda980-15e1-47fa-a0c1-edb5a7e4ba42" facs="#m-ed41f9e8-4099-4016-93e9-832d10751622" label="lyrics-like">N caritáte radicáti et fundáti, fúndum; t scire étiam superemi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b5580dd-15f8-4256-be60-8f2fb4e33b53" facs="#m-7e38e0cc-340d-4f98-8f5e-2be209c6f72f" label="lyrics-like">L ut possitis comprehéndere cum [néntem sciéntiae caritátem Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-2768a5f1-a599-4726-9c3a-1b7cdf264d3c" facs="#m-e9612ac2-df28-463a-b477-46f62243703b" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus sanctis, quae sit latitúdo! sti, * ut impleámini in omnem ple¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b169c6d-bb9f-42ac-ba7f-df0ba5478e33" facs="#m-6aaba99b-53b5-4adc-a18e-c7be93cd2017" label="lyrics-like">et longitúdo, et sublimitas et pro-Initúdinem Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-64e2f306-a84a-4a85-8118-89ca9a988c0f" facs="#m-f2e7224e-cc3b-42d2-8460-b7a93d1634b7" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-4509bb80-9003-4295-8b70-f0aa75712453" facs="#m-7af4cc1d-b936-4b8b-8554-9c4032b0e620" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-36fb8d29-0780-4a02-8912-f2f258d9abc3" facs="#m-e8cb83b1-c278-453e-92c6-775f87b5286c" label="lyrics-like">3AL Emó-ri-am fé-cit mi-rabí-li-um su-ó-rum “ Mi-se¬</l><l xml:id="m-51ceda0c-0904-418c-ab45-dd1c6165f183" facs="#m-1c567fd6-df68-4c06-af3a-0b5615a32409" label="lyrics-like">rá- tor Dóminus. Memó-ri-am. V. Escam dédit timéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-4867391b-2f0e-4eaa-8831-ebaeb18f6f4e" facs="#m-eee48132-d319-459b-b376-e1a62fbca639" label="lyrics-like">se. *Mi-será- tor. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Memó-ri-am.</l><l xml:id="m-dbf39056-d7cb-4dcd-91aa-52b88bb27a05" facs="#m-e1328c26-5a0b-4135-b255-b03b2da39333" label="lyrics-like">v. Hauriétis áquas in gáudio.</l><l xml:id="m-38e1d910-1b32-417c-bc47-79de8193bc69" facs="#m-ac7458ed-bdae-4d8e-a395-ff72ca7729b1" label="lyrics-like">B. De fontibus Salvatóris.</l></lg>
            </div>
